      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIN CITY NIGHTS (6) has been in sparkling form, last time showing blistering early pace and proving too slick around this track over 400m in 22.68, making it three wins on end. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has put together a string of wins and expected to go close again. ASTON NATIONAL (3) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his quick win three back, getting around Horsham over 410m in 23.27. Expecting another bold showing. RED HOT KERMARO (4) was out of placings last time (30.20) at Sandown in a Special conditions race, finishing sixth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Has already won out of this draw. Looks suited here and can measure up. PAW TREACLE (1) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
